cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this work, please cite it as below."
title: "Assay: A Protocol for Verifiable AI Model Evaluation"
authors:
  - family-names: Finazzi
    given-names: Nicola
    affiliation: "Intelligent System S.r.l."
version: "0.2.2"
date-released: "2026-08-19"
license: CC-BY-NC-ND-4.0
type: report
abstract: >-
  A three-layer protocol for trustworthy AI benchmarking: adaptive psychometric
  measurement (3PL IRT, Bayesian estimation, computerised adaptive testing,
  honeypot contamination detection), a pre-registration and commit-reveal
  protocol layer, and a public tamper-evident ledger. Includes a proof of
  concept with a manipulation red-team on 57,477 real arena votes.
